Package: python3-gamepadly
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Linux gamepad-to-keyboard/mouse mapper
 Gamepadly translates gamepad input into virtual keyboard and mouse events
 through uinput, using evmapy-compatible profiles. It provides the
 gamepadly Python package and the gamepadly-mapper command.
